  "modelNote": "Each variable is a scale score (one column), so the model is a path analysis of observed variables. PLS-SEM with 5,000 bootstrap draws gives the indirect effects Demands → Burnout → QuitIntention and Resources → Engagement → QuitIntention with confidence intervals.",
